Doki - Universal Container Engine

Usage:  doki [OPTIONS] COMMAND

Management Commands:
  container   Manage containers
  image       Manage images
  network     Manage networks
  volume      Manage volumes
  system      Manage Doki
  pod         Manage pods
  kube        Kubernetes integration
  compose     Multi-container orchestration
  mesh        DokiLink-Lite mesh management
  link        DokiLink-Lite peer management
  deps        Inspect and manage host dependencies

Commands:
  run         Create and run a new container from an image
  exec        Execute a command in a running container
  ps          List containers
  build       Build an image from a Dokifile
  pull        Download an image from a registry
  push        Upload an image to a registry
  images      List images
  login       Log in to a registry
  logout      Log out from a registry
  search      Search Docker Hub for images
  version     Show the Doki version information
  info        Display system-wide information
  play        Play Kubernetes YAML
  generate    Generate Kubernetes YAML
  unshare     Run command in user namespace
  mount       Mount container root filesystem
  unmount     Unmount container root filesystem

Run 'doki COMMAND --help' for more information.
